1349560214,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of high-amplitude instrumental noise with its highest spike at ~0.14 s and a broad, noisy baseline hump around 1.5–2.2 s. It completely lacks a coherent, resolved Na+ peak and the required Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak 1.49 s later.",,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,1.2346299723135952e-14,-1000
1352875144,non-3-OH,The spectrum consists entirely of chaotic instrumental noise across the 0 to 6.4 µs range with its maximum amplitude near 0.1 µs. It lacks both a coherent Na+ peak in the expected 1.4–2.0 µs range and a corresponding Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak 1.49 µs later.,,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,3.2330200663973844e-14,-1000
1352780135,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of high-amplitude instrumental noise across the 0 to 6.4 µs range, with a maximum at ~0.1 µs and no coherent peak structure. It completely lacks a dominant Na+ peak between 1.4 and 2.0 µs and any subsequent Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak 1.49 µs later.",,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,1.6402100150628672e-14,-1000
1347780210,non-3-OH,The spectrum consists entirely of instrumental noise with a single sharp spike at ~0.14 µs and chaotic fluctuations across the rest of the 0 to 6.4 µs range. It completely lacks a dominant Na+ peak between 1.4 and 2.0 µs and the corresponding Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak 1.49 µs later.,,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,5.5933498799417766e-14,-1000
1347889774,non-3-OH,The spectrum consists entirely of instrumental noise with a sharp initial spike at ~0.14 bcs and continuous random fluctuations across the entire 0 to 6.4 bcs range. It completely lacks a dominant Na+ peak between 1.4 and 2.0 bcs and any subsequent Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak ~1.49 bcs later.,,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,1.4810999581188304e-14,-1000
1352849646,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of high-amplitude instrumental noise across the 0 to 6.4 µs range, with its highest spike at ~0.1 µs and no coherent Na+ peak (expected between 1.4 and 2.0 µs) or subsequent Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak 1.49 µs later.",,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,2.4801400828346722e-14,-1000
1352726603,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of high-amplitude instrumental noise with its maximum value at ~0.10 bc, completely lacking a coherent Na+ peak between 1.4 and 2.0 bc or any subsequent Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak 1.49 bc later.",,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,2.0099100809796263e-14,-1000
1349274480,non-3-OH,The spectrum consists entirely of instrumental noise with its highest spike at ~0.13 s rather than a dominant Na+ peak between 1.4 and 2.0 s. It completely lacks a coherent Na+ peak and the required Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak 1.49 s later.,,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,1.539360070077107e-14,-1000
1349581074,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of high-amplitude instrumental noise fluctuating between 0.6 and 1.0 across the entire 0 to 6.4 µs range, with a single noise spike reaching 1.0 at ~1.99 µs. It completely lacks a coherent Na+ peak and the diagnostic Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak ~1.49 µs later (around 3.48 µs).",,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,1.1221100308970392e-14,-1000
1351672995,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of high-amplitude instrumental noise across the 0 to 6.4 µs range, with a maximum at ~0.1 µs rather than a dominant Na+ peak between 1.4 and 2.0 µs. It lacks any coherent peak structure or the required Na(NaOH)+ peak separated by 1.49 µs.",,1,projects/355771430623/locations/global/batchPredictionJobs/8705913964715835392,0,3.4020399344858454e-13,-1000
